  "description": "HTTP-based SDK for TAF FileManager Service. Provides BusContext extension methods for fetching images and files as streams. Features: context.GetImageAsync(path) for images, context.GetFileAsync(path, fileName) for file downloads, graceful 404 handling (returns null), context header propagation (TenantId, AppId, EnvironmentId). Designed for Base64 image embedding in PDF reports and Excel file downloads.",
